@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
}

<div class="spacer"></div>

<div class="row p-3">
    <ul class="breadcrumb w-100 p-2 m-0 link-normal">
        <li class="breadcrumb-item">
            <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">
                <i class="fas fa-home me-1"></i>Home
            </a>
        </li>
        <li class="breadcrumb-item active">
            <a href="#">
                @ViewData["Title"]
            </a>
        </li>
    </ul>

    <h1 class="mt-3 col-12 px-0">@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
    <p>
        Nilu Digital Store began with a simple vision to help people avail digital products and services easily and safely.
        We are starting in 2022 with the online sale of digital software license keys, gift cards and video game activation codes 
        as part of a family business. We will try to regularly expand our range of products based on customer demand. We are committed to 
        providing customers with quality products at affordable prices with instant and secured delivery via email.
    </p>
    <p>
        Today millions of people use the Internet on their digital devices for needs such as
        communication, information, entertainment, business and the number of users is increasing day
        by day. The increasing popularity of electronic devices and the Internet has given rise to the demand of digital products such
        as gift cards, online subscriptions, video game activation keys, software license codes, virtual items etc. We aim to 
        be a trusted place for all of our customers where they can safely purchase digital products and services.
    </p>
</div>

